DisplaySwarm - third-party notices
==============================

This file lists third-party material that DisplaySwarm's source tree contains or
that a DisplaySwarm release depends on, with the notices each licence requires.
Ship it with every binary release.


1. Virtual Display Driver (VirtualDrivers/Virtual-Display-Driver)
-----------------------------------------------------------------

Status in this release: NOT bundled. DisplaySwarm's Windows host talks to an
installation of this driver that the user made (winget or the project's
release), through the driver's documented settings file and named pipe.
No driver code or binary is included.

Contained in the DisplaySwarm source tree: a short excerpt of the driver's
sample settings file (vdd_settings.xml), trimmed and used as a unit-test
fixture in host/src/display/windows_vdd.rs.

