3. Interoperability sources consulted, nothing taken
----------------------------------------------------

The Virtual Display Driver's control protocol was learned by reading that
project's source (MIT) and observing what its companion app
Virtual-Driver-Control sends. Virtual-Driver-Control's repository carries
no licence; no code from it is in DisplaySwarm.
